  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Demo Cargo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nijland Cycling B.V. specialises in the development and production of innovative bicycles, such as heavy-duty cargo bikes.The Chariot FS2 is an electrically powered cargo bike, specifically developed for situations where large volumes and weights need to be transported in busy urban areas.In Tanzania, due to rapid urbanisation and the associated heavy traffic congestion and poor air quality, there is a strong focus on sustainable urban mobility and more efficient logistic solutions. With the Chariot FS2, Nijland targets companies and organisations that transport goods daily in busy urban areas and face traffic congestion, high fuel costs, maintenance burdens, and limited accessibility and parking options.During the demonstration project in Arusha, 3 cargo bikes (including IoT monitoring) are being deployed in the daily logistics processes/parcel delivery of local logistic companies.</narrative>
  </description>
